<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[Hello,<div><br></div><div>The international transfer credits have been added to the student's DARS. Please run a new audit for the updates to appears. International transfer hours appear as one lump sum on the student's DARS record.&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>You should be able to see the evaluated transcript in WebXtender/AppXtender. If you are unable to see the transcript please let us know and we can send you a copy of the annotated transcript for you to review.</div><div><br></div><div>If you have any further questions or requests please send them to <a href="mailto:intltransreq@asu.edu">intltransreq@asu.edu</a>.</div><div><br></div><div>Thank you,</div><div><br></div><div>International Admission Services</div><div>Arizona State University</div>]]></td>
</tr>
